sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as InteractionRepository
    participant SSOT as Room row (Ch 3)
    participant Out as Outbox (Ch 31)
    participant Srv as Server (truth)

    User->>Repo: like(postId)
    Repo->>SSOT: save pre-action (liked=false, count=41); set liked=true, count=42 (optimistic)
    Note over SSOT: UI updates instantly EVERYWHERE - feed/detail, Ch 3/6
    Repo->>Out: enqueue Like{idempotencyKey} (Ch 15/31)
    Out->>Srv: POST like (idempotent)
    alt success
        Srv-->>Out: real count = 57 (others liked too)
        Out->>SSOT: reconcile -> count=57 (replace guess, Ch 32)
    else genuine 4xx (blocked)
        Srv-->>Out: 403
        Out->>SSOT: rollback -> liked=false, count=41 + tell user
    else transient 5xx/network
        Out->>Out: keep optimistic + retry (Ch 2/31)
    end
